/* Asteroids Deluxe - the 6502 memory model, as C.
 *
 * GENERATED by disasm/mkstate.py from the RAM layout in
 * PG0123.MAC.  Do not hand-edit: regenerate.
 *
 * Every field is followed by a _Static_assert pinning its offset
 * to the address the ROM uses.  That is the point of generating
 * this - the port inherits the verification instead of a copy.
 *
 * Layout is rev 2 (MAME astdelux2), the build Atari's source
 * archive documents.  See disasm/README.md#revisions.
 */
